### 발송 자격 내부 API 수동 검증
### 준비: docker compose up -d postgres redis, MANYAK_INTERNAL_SHARED_SECRET를 주입한 뒤 ./gradlew bootRun.
### 실제 시크릿은 IntelliJ의 커밋하지 않는 HTTP 환경 파일에 internalSecret 변수로 넣습니다.
### auth/auth-login-google.http로 로컬 테스트 회원의 accessToken을 얻습니다.
### 0~12는 순서대로 실행합니다. 13은 시크릿을 비우고 서버를 재시작한 뒤 별도로 실행합니다.
### 이 파일은 발송하지 않습니다. 테스트 회원의 기존 설정을 조회하고 임시 토큰을 등록한 뒤 정리합니다.
### 토큰이 이미 10개인 회원을 쓰면 등록 시 가장 오래된 기기가 축출되므로 전용 테스트 회원을 사용합니다.
### 정지, 탈퇴 및 11기기 상한은 InternalPushEligibilityControllerIntegrationTests에서 검증합니다.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = PUT_A_TEST_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@manualToken = internal-eligibility-manual-token
@day = 2026-09-21T03:00:00Z
@night = 2026-09-21T13:00:00Z
@missingPublicId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000

### 0. 서버 상태
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

> {%
    client.test("서버 정상", () => client.assert(response.status === 200, `expected=200 actual=${response.status}`));
%}

### 1. 테스트 회원 publicId 저장
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

> {%
    client.test("회원 조회", () => client.assert(response.status === 200, `expected=200 actual=${response.status}`));
    if (response.status === 200) client.global.set("eligibilityPublicId", response.body.id);
%}

### 2. 현재 동의 상태 저장
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/push-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

> {%
    client.test("동의 조회", () => client.assert(response.status === 200, `expected=200 actual=${response.status}`));
    if (response.status === 200) {
        client.global.set("eligibilityServicePush", response.body.servicePush);
        client.global.set("eligibilityMarketingPush", response.body.marketingPush);
        client.global.set("eligibilityNightPush", response.body.marketingNightPush);
    }
%}

### 3. 임시 WEB 토큰 등록
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/push-tokens
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"token":"{{manualToken}}","platform":"WEB"}

> {%
    client.test("임시 토큰 등록", () => client.assert(response.status === 204, `expected=204 actual=${response.status}`));
%}

### 4. SERVICE 자격과 토큰 (2번에서 읽은 수신 설정 기준)
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/users/{{eligibilityPublicId}}/push-eligibility?kind=SERVICE&at={{day}}
X-Manyak-Internal-Secret: {{internalSecret}}

> {%
    client.test("서비스 자격", () => {
        const allowed = String(client.global.get("eligibilityServicePush")) === "true";
        client.assert(response.status === 200, `expected=200 actual=${response.status}`);
        client.assert(response.body.allowed === allowed, `expected=${allowed} actual=${response.body.allowed}`);
        client.assert(response.body.reason === (allowed ? "OK" : "SERVICE_PUSH_DISABLED"), `unexpected reason=${response.body.reason}`);
        client.assert(allowed ? response.body.tokens.length > 0 && response.body.tokens.length <= 10 : response.body.tokens.length === 0,
            `unexpected token count=${response.body.tokens.length}`);
        client.assert(response.body.tokens.every(t => Object.keys(t).sort().join(",") === "platform,token"), "토큰 응답 필드가 다릅니다.");
    });
%}

### 5. 주간 MARKETING (KST 12시)
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/users/{{eligibilityPublicId}}/push-eligibility?kind=MARKETING&at={{day}}
X-Manyak-Internal-Secret: {{internalSecret}}

> {%
    client.test("주간 광고 자격", () => {
        const allowed = String(client.global.get("eligibilityMarketingPush")) === "true";
        client.assert(response.status === 200, `expected=200 actual=${response.status}`);
        client.assert(response.body.allowed === allowed, `expected=${allowed} actual=${response.body.allowed}`);
        client.assert(response.body.reason === (allowed ? "OK" : "MARKETING_NOT_AGREED"), `unexpected reason=${response.body.reason}`);
    });
%}

### 6. 야간 MARKETING (KST 22시)
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/users/{{eligibilityPublicId}}/push-eligibility?kind=MARKETING&at={{night}}
X-Manyak-Internal-Secret: {{internalSecret}}

> {%
    client.test("야간 광고 자격", () => {
        const allowed = String(client.global.get("eligibilityMarketingPush")) === "true" && String(client.global.get("eligibilityNightPush")) === "true";
        client.assert(response.status === 200, `expected=200 actual=${response.status}`);
        client.assert(response.body.allowed === allowed, `expected=${allowed} actual=${response.body.allowed}`);
        client.assert(response.body.reason === (allowed ? "OK" : "MARKETING_NOT_AGREED"), `unexpected reason=${response.body.reason}`);
    });
%}

### 7. 회원 부재도 200 (missingPublicId가 DB에 없는지 확인)
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/users/{{missingPublicId}}/push-eligibility?kind=SERVICE&at={{day}}
X-Manyak-Internal-Secret: {{internalSecret}}

> {%
    client.test("없는 회원 거절", () => {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, `expected=200 actual=${response.status}`);
        client.assert(response.body.allowed === false && response.body.reason === "USER_NOT_FOUND" && response.body.tokens.length === 0,
            `unexpected response=${JSON.stringify(response.body)}`);
    });
%}

### 8. 사용자 access 토큰만 보내면 401 (시크릿 누락)
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/users/{{eligibilityPublicId}}/push-eligibility?kind=SERVICE&at={{day}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

> {%
    client.test("사용자 인증으로 대체 불가", () => client.assert(response.status === 401, `expected=401 actual=${response.status}`));
%}

### 9. 시크릿 불일치
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/users/{{eligibilityPublicId}}/push-eligibility?kind=SERVICE&at={{day}}
X-Manyak-Internal-Secret: intentionally-wrong-secret

> {%
    client.test("시크릿 불일치", () => client.assert(response.status === 401, `expected=401 actual=${response.status}`));
%}

### 10. 잘못된 kind
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/users/{{eligibilityPublicId}}/push-eligibility?kind=INVALID&at={{day}}
X-Manyak-Internal-Secret: {{internalSecret}}

> {%
    client.test("종류 검증", () => client.assert(response.status === 400, `expected=400 actual=${response.status}`));
%}

### 11. at 누락
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/users/{{eligibilityPublicId}}/push-eligibility?kind=SERVICE
X-Manyak-Internal-Secret: {{internalSecret}}

> {%
    client.test("시각 필수", () => client.assert(response.status === 400, `expected=400 actual=${response.status}`));
%}

### 12. 임시 토큰 정리 (기존 공개 삭제 API)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/push-tokens
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"token":"{{manualToken}}"}

> {%
    client.test("임시 토큰 정리", () => client.assert(response.status === 204, `expected=204 actual=${response.status}`));
%}

### 13. 별도 실행: 시크릿을 빈 값으로 재시작하면 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/users/{{missingPublicId}}/push-eligibility?kind=SERVICE&at={{day}}

> {%
    client.test("미설정 시 비활성", () => client.assert(response.status === 404, `expected=404 actual=${response.status}`));
%}

### 14. 자유 조회: 시크릿을 설정해 재시작하고 실제 publicId와 발송 직전 at으로 변경
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/users/{{eligibilityPublicId}}/push-eligibility?kind=SERVICE&at={{day}}
X-Manyak-Internal-Secret: {{internalSecret}}
